@* Three tiled layers. The pattern is what makes this cost nothing: however far the camera
   travels, the stars are one rect each and the browser does the tiling.

   Parallax is deliberately tiny. Even the nearest star is an absurdly long way away on the scale
   of a game about nudging planets around, so the far layer sits at 0 - fixed against the sky, no
   sliding at all - and the two nearer ones move only just enough to be noticed. Anything more
   reads as a painted backdrop being dragged past.

   The tile sizes are mutually awkward on purpose: three periods that don't divide into each other
   beat against one another, and the eye stops finding the grid. *@
<defs>
    <pattern id="sporbits-stars-far" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="120" height="120">
        <circle class="star-far" cx="9" cy="103" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="23" cy="41" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="31" cy="78" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="37" cy="7" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="48" cy="112" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="52" cy="55" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="61" cy="26" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="66" cy="91" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="74" cy="63" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="83" cy="14" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="89" cy="117" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="95" cy="47" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="104" cy="85" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="112" cy="33" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="117" cy="69" r="0.3" />
        <circle class="star-far" cx="15" cy="19" r="0.3" />
    </pattern>

    <pattern id="sporbits-stars-mid" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="170" height="170">
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="14" cy="61" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="38" cy="149" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="57" cy="22" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="72" cy="96" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="91" cy="134" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="108" cy="45" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="126" cy="112" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="141" cy="7" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="155" cy="79" r="0.45" />
        <circle class="star-mid" cx="163" cy="160" r="0.45" />
